  "description": "Why We Love It\nRide in style with this confidence-inspiring, fashionable bike that allows you to take your next adventure through and beyond the city. Wide, reliable tires resist punctures and tackle road debris and gravel, no problem. The step-through design with a split downtube offers comfort while standing over the bike, and adds some fun flair to the outlook. The style blends the drop bar outlook onto a stable beginner friendly bike.\n\nDisc brakes for precise braking and control in all terrain and variable weather conditions\n\nIntegrated dropouts and kickstand mount for the easy addition of accessories like panniers and kickstands\n\nAvailable with 700C wheels or 26-inch wheels on the XXS size\n\nTwo sets of brake levers — a standard set located on the drops and a secondary set on the flat portion of the drop bars\n\nMultiple color and graphics schemes\n\nLightweight and durable ALUXX-grade butted aluminum frame\n\nCompatible with RideSense chainstay-integrated wireless data transmitter\n\nDesigned using Liv’s 3F Design Philosophy to build bikes for women\n\nLivRight Sizing Philosophy for the perfect fit across all sizes\n\nEquipped with rack and fenders for running quick errands in any kind of weather (select models)",
